{"id":"geschworener","lemma":"Geschworener","pos":"noun","rank":3489,"glosses":["juror (male or of unspecified gender)"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈʃvoːʁənɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/De-Geschworener.ogg/De-Geschworener.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Geschworenen","plural":"Geschworene","feminine":"Geschworene"},"examples":[{"text":"Die Geschworenen kamen in den Gerichtssaal.","en":"The jurors came into the courtroom.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"courtroom"}]},{"text":"Sind die Geschworenen zu einem Urteil gelangt?","en":"Has the jury reached a verdict?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"judgment"},{"g":"to reach","l":"gelangen"}]},{"text":"Die Geschworenen fanden den Mann des Mordes schuldig.","en":"The jury found the man guilty of murder.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to find","l":"finden"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"murder","l":"Mord"},{"g":"[with genitive] guilty"}]},{"text":"Die Geschworenen betraten den Gerichtssaal.","en":"The jurors came into the courtroom.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to enter","l":"betreten"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"courtroom"}]},{"text":"Die Geschworenen befanden Tom für schuldig.","en":"The jury found Tom guilty.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to occupy a place","l":"befinden"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"[with genitive] guilty"}]}]}